{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Store is Closed",
    "steam_appid": 1593010,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<strong>You're trapped in an infinite furniture store</strong>, trying to survive against the mutant staff who attack at night. You must explore the store, alone or with your friends, to find a way out. Luckily, it\u2019s filled with furniture that can be used to craft weapons or build fortifications to survive the night.<br>Eventually you\u2019ll wander too deep into the store and attract something dangerous. <strong>The Managers.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/c257be0ba7c14905dc261869236a74d5.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/c257be0ba7c14905dc261869236a74d5.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/c257be0ba7c14905dc261869236a74d5.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You\u2019re stuck in an infinite furniture store. Mind your surroundings or you\u2019ll get lost.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/0565016c941f9452b2ac1a42b60e6078.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/0565016c941f9452b2ac1a42b60e6078.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/0565016c941f9452b2ac1a42b60e6078.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Everything in the store is destructible. You can move the furniture to make a base, or break it apart into resources for crafting.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meet the staff</h2><strong>The store is guarded by the staff</strong> and other creatures. They\u2019re all dangerous in unique ways.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4f144e5169bc3660e6e67cb453e28350.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4f144e5169bc3660e6e67cb453e28350.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4f144e5169bc3660e6e67cb453e28350.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The Managers are a force to be reckoned with. Nothing will stop them if they want you gone.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/6a00580df660d72fbb4e5531b08f83b6.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/6a00580df660d72fbb4e5531b08f83b6.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/6a00580df660d72fbb4e5531b08f83b6.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Most of the staff patrol the show floor. They\u2019re less aggressive during the day.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/6964cd6aeb66c2a137f5192344d9cff2.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/6964cd6aeb66c2a137f5192344d9cff2.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/6964cd6aeb66c2a137f5192344d9cff2.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The staff don't take kindly to seeing their furniture being destroyed.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4946624976189c9bf5af1150d67fffe9.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4946624976189c9bf5af1150d67fffe9.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4946624976189c9bf5af1150d67fffe9.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The Kids department isn\u2019t safe. The Biters hunt in packs.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/f9f4e679ba3f351abd06ccb347befd1a.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/f9f4e679ba3f351abd06ccb347befd1a.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/f9f4e679ba3f351abd06ccb347befd1a.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Keep an eye on the mannequins.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/00e0f673a5a198d121eca024cd7a6fac.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/00e0f673a5a198d121eca024cd7a6fac.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/00e0f673a5a198d121eca024cd7a6fac.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The TV Golems patrol the warehouses. Don't let them spot you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survival</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/7f2bbc1cd0534a1f44f776de85913efa.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/7f2bbc1cd0534a1f44f776de85913efa.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/7f2bbc1cd0534a1f44f776de85913efa.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>You\u2019ll need food to survive.</strong> It\u2019s not clear where the cafeteria food comes from.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/9488eff5e2b19d26f579ac64077245a8.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/9488eff5e2b19d26f579ac64077245a8.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/9488eff5e2b19d26f579ac64077245a8.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Building a base is vital. It's better to sleep at night and explore in the day.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/301ef7d665711a27bac78aca1647ac78.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/301ef7d665711a27bac78aca1647ac78.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/301ef7d665711a27bac78aca1647ac78.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Building on top of the shelves in the warehouses can be a good way to stay hidden.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/02385be472a642d06b49602ed45411b9.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/02385be472a642d06b49602ed45411b9.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/02385be472a642d06b49602ed45411b9.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>The game features online CO OP.</strong> You and your friends can survive together.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Defend yourself</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/820451a5ce699798c8cd6622b36e9947.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/820451a5ce699798c8cd6622b36e9947.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/820451a5ce699798c8cd6622b36e9947.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The flamethrower can clear a lot of furniture, but watch out, the fire might spread.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4f144e5169bc3660e6e67cb453e28350.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4f144e5169bc3660e6e67cb453e28350.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4f144e5169bc3660e6e67cb453e28350.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Some things won't feel pain.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/e5eac54f82086d0ab0df7c876d7291a5.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/e5eac54f82086d0ab0df7c876d7291a5.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/e5eac54f82086d0ab0df7c876d7291a5.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You can find a chainsaw in the gardening department. It makes quick work of wooden furniture.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/9b7d01eaad05ad789284327bbf56b27c.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/9b7d01eaad05ad789284327bbf56b27c.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/9b7d01eaad05ad789284327bbf56b27c.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The chainsaw is a powerful but loud weapon.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4a2c64cbfb324603198fdd974189cb8e.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4a2c64cbfb324603198fdd974189cb8e.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4a2c64cbfb324603198fdd974189cb8e.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>If you\u2019re cornered, the sledgehammer can create an escape route.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Progression</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/fb51feda18c570439f3466551105d83c.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/fb51feda18c570439f3466551105d83c.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/fb51feda18c570439f3466551105d83c.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Craft new weapons from objects found in the store.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/74cfe5d767fa82060eda7702590309a7.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/74cfe5d767fa82060eda7702590309a7.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/74cfe5d767fa82060eda7702590309a7.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You\u2019ll build more elaborate bases as time goes on.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4f144e5169bc3660e6e67cb453e28350.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4f144e5169bc3660e6e67cb453e28350.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4f144e5169bc3660e6e67cb453e28350.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Shopping carts are handy but can also be deadly.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Exploration</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/ed9d5304487243fe0afc9845481592da.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/ed9d5304487243fe0afc9845481592da.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/ed9d5304487243fe0afc9845481592da.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Strange departments float above the show floor. Build towers to gain access to them.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/71a295f207e8d7383e3ac38cab7ec6b0.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/71a295f207e8d7383e3ac38cab7ec6b0.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/71a295f207e8d7383e3ac38cab7ec6b0.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>If you\u2019re unlucky you might find your way into one of the pocket dimensions connected to the store, such as the backrooms.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The SCP Foundation</h2>An organisation called the SCP Foundation is studying the store. Infiltrate and explore their underground labs. There you\u2019ll find more advanced weapons, crafting materials and secrets about the store.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4c318816cf6fa25fbd0c632d85e6f398.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4c318816cf6fa25fbd0c632d85e6f398.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4c318816cf6fa25fbd0c632d85e6f398.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You\u2019ll need to find an SCP keycard first to enter their labs.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/e083badeca22b58da142ec3f18092b6b.avif?t=1729674661\" data-has-big /></div><br>The laboratories are crawling with security.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/af5bbdc8d363177fd1b6648c471688e1.avif?t=1729674661\" data-has-big /></div><br>The SCP Organisation experiment on the staff.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/35e4a2dfd19c9d3a94b09ef310ddd59e.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/35e4a2dfd19c9d3a94b09ef310ddd59e.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/35e4a2dfd19c9d3a94b09ef310ddd59e.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The labs contain other anomalies. Turn off the power to let them loose.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/2dae03a6bd1bb5e3bc626a1c319b1918.avif?t=1729674661\" /></div><br>Read the research done by the Foundation on the staff and store.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>You're trapped in an infinite furniture store</strong>, trying to survive against the mutant staff who attack at night. You must explore the store, alone or with your friends, to find a way out. Luckily, it\u2019s filled with furniture that can be used to craft weapons or build fortifications to survive the night.<br>Eventually you\u2019ll wander too deep into the store and attract something dangerous. <strong>The Managers.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/c257be0ba7c14905dc261869236a74d5.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/c257be0ba7c14905dc261869236a74d5.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/c257be0ba7c14905dc261869236a74d5.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You\u2019re stuck in an infinite furniture store. Mind your surroundings or you\u2019ll get lost.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/0565016c941f9452b2ac1a42b60e6078.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/0565016c941f9452b2ac1a42b60e6078.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/0565016c941f9452b2ac1a42b60e6078.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Everything in the store is destructible. You can move the furniture to make a base, or break it apart into resources for crafting.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meet the staff</h2><strong>The store is guarded by the staff</strong> and other creatures. They\u2019re all dangerous in unique ways.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4f144e5169bc3660e6e67cb453e28350.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4f144e5169bc3660e6e67cb453e28350.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4f144e5169bc3660e6e67cb453e28350.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The Managers are a force to be reckoned with. Nothing will stop them if they want you gone.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/6a00580df660d72fbb4e5531b08f83b6.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/6a00580df660d72fbb4e5531b08f83b6.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/6a00580df660d72fbb4e5531b08f83b6.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Most of the staff patrol the show floor. They\u2019re less aggressive during the day.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/6964cd6aeb66c2a137f5192344d9cff2.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/6964cd6aeb66c2a137f5192344d9cff2.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/6964cd6aeb66c2a137f5192344d9cff2.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The staff don't take kindly to seeing their furniture being destroyed.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4946624976189c9bf5af1150d67fffe9.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4946624976189c9bf5af1150d67fffe9.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4946624976189c9bf5af1150d67fffe9.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The Kids department isn\u2019t safe. The Biters hunt in packs.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/f9f4e679ba3f351abd06ccb347befd1a.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/f9f4e679ba3f351abd06ccb347befd1a.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/f9f4e679ba3f351abd06ccb347befd1a.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Keep an eye on the mannequins.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/00e0f673a5a198d121eca024cd7a6fac.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/00e0f673a5a198d121eca024cd7a6fac.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/00e0f673a5a198d121eca024cd7a6fac.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The TV Golems patrol the warehouses. Don't let them spot you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survival</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/7f2bbc1cd0534a1f44f776de85913efa.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/7f2bbc1cd0534a1f44f776de85913efa.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/7f2bbc1cd0534a1f44f776de85913efa.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>You\u2019ll need food to survive.</strong> It\u2019s not clear where the cafeteria food comes from.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/9488eff5e2b19d26f579ac64077245a8.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/9488eff5e2b19d26f579ac64077245a8.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/9488eff5e2b19d26f579ac64077245a8.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Building a base is vital. It's better to sleep at night and explore in the day.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/301ef7d665711a27bac78aca1647ac78.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/301ef7d665711a27bac78aca1647ac78.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/301ef7d665711a27bac78aca1647ac78.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Building on top of the shelves in the warehouses can be a good way to stay hidden.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/02385be472a642d06b49602ed45411b9.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/02385be472a642d06b49602ed45411b9.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/02385be472a642d06b49602ed45411b9.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>The game features online CO OP.</strong> You and your friends can survive together.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Defend yourself</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/820451a5ce699798c8cd6622b36e9947.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/820451a5ce699798c8cd6622b36e9947.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/820451a5ce699798c8cd6622b36e9947.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The flamethrower can clear a lot of furniture, but watch out, the fire might spread.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4f144e5169bc3660e6e67cb453e28350.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4f144e5169bc3660e6e67cb453e28350.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4f144e5169bc3660e6e67cb453e28350.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Some things won't feel pain.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/e5eac54f82086d0ab0df7c876d7291a5.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/e5eac54f82086d0ab0df7c876d7291a5.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/e5eac54f82086d0ab0df7c876d7291a5.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You can find a chainsaw in the gardening department. It makes quick work of wooden furniture.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/9b7d01eaad05ad789284327bbf56b27c.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/9b7d01eaad05ad789284327bbf56b27c.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/9b7d01eaad05ad789284327bbf56b27c.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The chainsaw is a powerful but loud weapon.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4a2c64cbfb324603198fdd974189cb8e.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4a2c64cbfb324603198fdd974189cb8e.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4a2c64cbfb324603198fdd974189cb8e.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>If you\u2019re cornered, the sledgehammer can create an escape route.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Progression</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/fb51feda18c570439f3466551105d83c.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/fb51feda18c570439f3466551105d83c.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/fb51feda18c570439f3466551105d83c.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Craft new weapons from objects found in the store.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/74cfe5d767fa82060eda7702590309a7.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/74cfe5d767fa82060eda7702590309a7.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/74cfe5d767fa82060eda7702590309a7.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You\u2019ll build more elaborate bases as time goes on.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4f144e5169bc3660e6e67cb453e28350.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4f144e5169bc3660e6e67cb453e28350.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4f144e5169bc3660e6e67cb453e28350.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Shopping carts are handy but can also be deadly.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Exploration</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/ed9d5304487243fe0afc9845481592da.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/ed9d5304487243fe0afc9845481592da.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/ed9d5304487243fe0afc9845481592da.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Strange departments float above the show floor. Build towers to gain access to them.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/71a295f207e8d7383e3ac38cab7ec6b0.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/71a295f207e8d7383e3ac38cab7ec6b0.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/71a295f207e8d7383e3ac38cab7ec6b0.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>If you\u2019re unlucky you might find your way into one of the pocket dimensions connected to the store, such as the backrooms.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The SCP Foundation</h2>An organisation called the SCP Foundation is studying the store. Infiltrate and explore their underground labs. There you\u2019ll find more advanced weapons, crafting materials and secrets about the store.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4c318816cf6fa25fbd0c632d85e6f398.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4c318816cf6fa25fbd0c632d85e6f398.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/4c318816cf6fa25fbd0c632d85e6f398.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You\u2019ll need to find an SCP keycard first to enter their labs.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/e083badeca22b58da142ec3f18092b6b.avif?t=1729674661\" data-has-big /></div><br>The laboratories are crawling with security.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/af5bbdc8d363177fd1b6648c471688e1.avif?t=1729674661\" data-has-big /></div><br>The SCP Organisation experiment on the staff.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/35e4a2dfd19c9d3a94b09ef310ddd59e.poster.avif?t=1729674661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/35e4a2dfd19c9d3a94b09ef310ddd59e.webm?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/35e4a2dfd19c9d3a94b09ef310ddd59e.mp4?t=1729674661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The labs contain other anomalies. Turn off the power to let them loose.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1593010/extras/2dae03a6bd1bb5e3bc626a1c319b1918.avif?t=1729674661\" /></div><br>Read the research done by the Foundation on the staff and store.",
    "short_description": "The Store is Closed is a coop survival game set in an infinite furniture store. When the lights go out, the staff attack. You\u2019ll need to craft weapons, and build fortifications to survive the night. Explore the underground SCP laboratories and build towers to the sky to find a way out.",
